_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/40"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "100 metres, Men" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "15 – 16 August 2008"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/813"} "Beijing Guojia Tiyuchang, Beijing Aolinpike Gongyuan, Beijing"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/257142"} "80 from 64 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "Going into the 2008 season, the favorites for the title of World’s Fastest Man were " [:a {:href "/athletes/114549"} "Tyson Gay"] " (USA) and " [:a {:href "/athletes/105482"} "Asafa Powell"] " (JAM). Gay had won the 100 and 200 at the 2007 World Championships and Powell was a two-time world record setter. But in May 2008 Jamaica’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/105512"} "Usain Bolt"] " broke Powell’s world record when he ran 9.72 at a meet in New York. Formerly considered primarily a 200 runner, he made the 100 a highly anticipated showdown between the big three sprinters. Gay won the American Olympic Trials in 9.68, but it was wind-aided and could not count for record purposes. Unfortunately, in the 200 at the Trials, he pulled up with a hamstring problem, would not be at his best in Beijing, and did not get past the semi-finals."] "\n\n" [:p {} "But that almost certainly had no effect on the outcome of the final. Usain Bolt was not known as the fastest starter but at 30 metres he was about equal to " [:a {:href "/athletes/114541"} "Richard Thompson"] " (TRI), when he accelerated seemingly into another world. By 80 metres he had a huge lead and he then shut it down, turning around, dropping his arms in celebration, and costing himself some time. But he still broke the world record with 9.69, winning by 0.20 over Thompson. Estimates of his potential time, had he run thru the tape, ranged as low as 9.55 and this was with zero wind assistance. Powell was well-beaten, finishing fifth."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2163"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/105512"} "Usain Bolt"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JAM"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JAM.png"}] "JAM"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3025"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/114541"} "Richard Thompson"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/TTO"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/TTO.png"}] "TTO"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3282"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/114563"} "Walter Dix"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "1003"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/105487"} "Churandy Martina"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AHO"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AHO.png"}] "AHO"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "5"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2142"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/105482"} "Asafa Powell"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JAM"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JAM.png"}] "JAM"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td 